What is a Loop?
For Loop:
Syntax:
     for(initialization; condition; increment){
      // code to be executed
     }

Example:
        for (let i=1; i<=5; i++) {
          console.log("Number: " + i);
        }

  output --> Number:1
                Number:2
                Number:3
                Number:4
                Number:5

While Loop:
Syntax:
     While (condition) {
     // code to be executed
     }

Example:
         let i=1;
        while (i <= 3) {
          console.log("Hello" + i);
          i++;
        }

   output --> Hello 1
               Hello 2
               Hello 3

Do....While Loop: 
Syntax:
    do{
      // code to be executed
    } while (condition);

Example:
        let i=1;
        do{
           console.log("Count: " + i);
           i++;
        } while (i <= 3);

   output ---> Count:1
               Count:2
               Count:3
